  "body": "NodeJS is [looking](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-async-iteration/issues/74) into supporting async iterables as a way to stream data, and it would be great if fetch (or the readable stream part of fetch) supported the same interface. This would make easier to move code between nodejs and the browser. ",
